{"id":"46534a06054da129","group":"29","path":"29/29-cor-p-np-fo-lfp-so.md","title":"P=NP刻画","display":"cor-p-np-fo-lfp-so — P=NP刻画","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-cor-p-np-fo-lfp-so","aliases":["29-cor-p-np-fo-lfp-so"],"display":"cor-p-np-fo-lfp-so — P=NP刻画","depends_on":["[[29-thm-p-fo-lfp]]","[[29-thm-fagin-1974]]","[[29-thm-ph-equivalence]]","[[29-df-fo-q-fo]]","[[29-df-complexity-classes]]","[[29-df-relational-vocab]]","[[29-df-second-order]]","[[29-df-so-so-exists]]"],"source_locator":"Corollary 7.23, p.122, DjVu scan 137","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-cor-p-np-fo-lfp-so"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-cor-p-np-fo-lfp-so</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-p-np-fo-lfp-so — P=NP刻画"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9ff05b6487475241\" href=\"?note=9ff05b6487475241\" title=\"29-thm-p-fo-lfp\">29-thm-p-fo-lfp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"560196b62ae7159f\" href=\"?note=560196b62ae7159f\" title=\"29-thm-fagin-1974\">29-thm-fagin-1974</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e052662a4a07aa17\" href=\"?note=e052662a4a07aa17\" title=\"29-thm-ph-equivalence\">29-thm-ph-equivalence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"44836019093a45c6\" href=\"?note=44836019093a45c6\" title=\"29-df-relational-vocab\">29-df-relational-vocab</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4db9fd38055efd65\" href=\"?note=4db9fd38055efd65\" title=\"29-df-second-order\">29-df-second-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"dd316f316437dd24\" href=\"?note=dd316f316437dd24\" title=\"29-df-so-so-exists\">29-df-so-so-exists</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Corollary 7.23, p.122, DjVu scan 137"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\">\\(\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"44836019093a45c6\" href=\"?note=44836019093a45c6\" title=\"29-df-relational-vocab\">29-df-relational-vocab</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为其中不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span> 的输入词汇；所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q(\\mathcal L[&lt;])[\\tau]\">\\(Q(\\mathcal L[&lt;])[\\tau]\\)</span> 都在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span> 上解释。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm P^{&lt;}[\\tau],\\mathrm{NP}^{&lt;}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm P^{&lt;}[\\tau],\\mathrm{NP}^{&lt;}[\\tau]\\)</span> 是有序输入查询类，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Fagin 与多项式层次刻画应用于包含输入序的关系词汇；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 的有序域约定见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SO}\">\\(\\mathrm{SO}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\mathrm{SO}\">\\(\\exists\\mathrm{SO}\\)</span> 的句子集和语义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"4db9fd38055efd65\" href=\"?note=4db9fd38055efd65\" title=\"29-df-second-order\">29-df-second-order</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"dd316f316437dd24\" href=\"?note=dd316f316437dd24\" title=\"29-df-so-so-exists\">29-df-so-so-exists</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm P^{&lt;}[\\tau]=\\mathrm{NP}^{&lt;}[\\tau]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ Q(\\mathrm{FO(LFP)}[&lt;])[\\tau]=Q(\\exists\\mathrm{SO}[&lt;])[\\tau].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm P^{&lt;}[\\tau]=\\mathrm{NP}^{&lt;}[\\tau]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ Q(\\mathrm{FO(LFP)}[&lt;])[\\tau]=Q(\\exists\\mathrm{SO}[&lt;])[\\tau].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm P=\\mathrm{NP}\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\tau\\in\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\\mid&lt;\\notin\\sigma\\}\\quad Q(\\mathrm{FO(LFP)}[&lt;])[\\tau]=Q(\\mathrm{SO}[&lt;])[\\tau].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm P=\\mathrm{NP}\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\tau\\in\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\\mid&lt;\\notin\\sigma\\}\\quad Q(\\mathrm{FO(LFP)}[&lt;])[\\tau]=Q(\\mathrm{SO}[&lt;])[\\tau].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Corollary 7.23，印刷页 122，扫描页 137。第一式是固定词汇上的直接代换；第二式恢复原书针对全部有序输入的刻画。若 P=NP，则 PH=P；反向只需选能表示二进制串的关系词汇。两式均是等价命题，不断言开放等式成立。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-thm-p-fo-lfp","status":"resolved